1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:07,570
Setiap pagi, Pak Hasan punya satu ritual suci: ngopi di Warkop Bu Atin.

2
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:12,300
Pak Hasan: Bu, kopi hitam satu. Gulanya dikit aja...

3
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,580
Pak Hasan: Saya lagi diet.

4
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,215
Buk Atin: Diet... dari mana, Pak?

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:20,060
Pak Hasan: Ini bukan lemak, Bu. Ini tabungan!

6
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:29,495
Buk Atin: Baru mendidih, Pak...

7
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:30,198
Pak Hasan: BILANG DONG!

8
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:33,465
Bima: Tendangan... HALILINTAAAR!

9
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:40,415
Rara: Bim... itu arahnya ke warkop.

10
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:40,950
Bima: ...Waduh.

11
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:44,090
Pak Hasan: Akhirnya... tenang juga.

12
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:54,215
Buk Atin: Kopinya nambah satu ya, Pak. Saya catat.

13
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:01,820
Bima: Pak... bolanya boleh diambil?

14
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:03,607
Pak Hasan: BIMAAAAA!!!

15
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:15,450
Nana: Besok pasti kejadian lagi.
